This is the object of Prop.4.4 / Thm 3.14. It is the only object allowed to be called `kappa_V`.

> **Definition 2.1* [Canonical, SAVGS base].** Fix a SAVGS
> `S = (B,E,pi,epsilon,Gamma)` with `B` a compact stratified `C^2` manifold with corners, `pi:E -> B` a bundle, `epsilon` a tameness function and `Gamma = Gamma^{GC}[r_{tau,beta,D}]` the GC-connection of Def 3.1.
